    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「天体望遠鏡の設置を手伝ってくれたうえに、こんな……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「うち、転校生くんに寄りかかりっぱなしやわぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「そんな心配せんでも、大丈夫やと思うねんけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「入院した、ゆうても。つゆちゃん、いつもこの時期は体調を崩すから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「でも。つゆちゃん、近ごろ無理してたみたいやから。心配やわ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「って、うちのほうが『心配せんでも』言うてんのに、自分がしてるやんなぁ。あはは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「えぇっと。お見舞い品には、どの花がえぇんかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「お見舞い品とかもってくと、つゆちゃん逆に気ぃ遣うんやけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「元気になってもらいたいもん、つゆちゃんが喜びそうなもん届けてあげよな～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「ん～、果物とかのほうがえぇんやろか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「でも、つゆちゃんアレルギーおおいからなぁ。食べられへんもんやったら、あかんもんなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「あっ、転校生くん。それはあかんねん、すぐ散る花は縁起がよくあらへんよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「ずっと咲いてるのがえぇのん、ゆうてもお花なんかどれも散るかなぁ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「散らんのがえぇいうたら、造花とかやろか。でも生きてる花のがえぇもんなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「ただあんま高価いのん買ぉてくと、つゆちゃん怒るねんよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「つゆちゃん……」"
